  "description": "Champions Tavern is your go-to spot for the ultimate blend of live sports thrills and laid-back American dining. Immerse yourself in the game on our multiple large screens while indulging in a menu that boasts the best burger in Amman. Our extensive drink selection spans local favorites to international delights, ensuring there's something for every palate. Join us for a family-friendly experience with non-smoking weekends until 5:00 pm. Make the most of sunny days on our inviting terrace during summer, or savor the views in the cozy ambiance during winter. Champions Tavern—where great food meets the excitement of the game!",
